mo>]</mo><mo>⇒</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>)</mo></math>  is incorrect.<br >Energy/Work  <math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>L</mi><msup><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>  (using,  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></math> <br > <math><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math> <br > <math><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>  is correct.<br > <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mtext> </mtext><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>L</mi><msup><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>⇒</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>)</mo></math>  is correct.<br >Linear momentum  <math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>L</mi><msup><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math> <br > <math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>  is correct.",
